{"step_index":41,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-24T23:20:42Z","content":"Okay, I've carefully looked at all 3 screenshots. Here is what each one shows and what you need to do:\n\n---\n\n### Screenshot 1 — Billing Setup Page (Before Error)\nThis is the **\"Add your billing account details\"** page on Google AI Studio. It shows:\n- **Account:** priyanshu (Individual, India, ID: 2908-8415-9767)\n- **Payment method:** UPI: QR code\n- **Right side clearly says:** *\"\\$300 Welcome credit... **Excludes Gemini API.**\"*\n\n> ⚠️ **Important notice you may have missed:** Even if billing setup succeeds, the \\$300 credit **explicitly excludes the Gemini API**. So it won't help you generate videos through the API anyway.\n\n---\n\n### Screenshot 2 — The Error After QR Scan\n**Error:** `Billing setup can't be completed. This action couldn't be completed. [OR_BACR2_44]`\n\n**What it means:** Google's payment verification failed. This is a very common error in India because of RBI regulations on auto-debit mandates. UPI QR code payment often fails for this type of international/recurring billing verification.\n\n**How to fix it (try in this order):**\n1. **Use a Credit Card instead of UPI** — Credit cards have much higher success rates for Google Cloud billing verification\n2. **Enable international transactions** on your card via your bank's app (net banking)\n3. **Try in Incognito mode** or a different browser\n4. **Go to [payments.google.com](https://payments.google.com)** and check if there are any alerts or blocks on your payment profile\n5. **Don't retry rapidly** — wait 24 hours between attempts, or your bank may flag it as fraud\n\n---\n\n### Screenshot 3 — Google AI Studio API Keys Page (Unrelated to Billing)\nThis shows your **AI Studio dashboard** with 2 API keys:\n\n| Key | Project | Created | Billing |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `...d0RA` | Gemini Project 1 | Aug 25, 2026 | **Free tier** |\n| `...tNDg` | Default Gemini Project | Aug 12, 2026 | **Free tier** |\n\nBoth keys are on the **Free tier** with no billing attached. This is the key you gave me earlier (`...d0RA`), and this is exactly why the video generation script failed with `RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED` — **video generation (Veo) is not available on the Free tier.** It requires a paid billing account.\n\n---\n\n### Do you need to set up billing?\n\n**For text/chat/image understanding tasks:** No. Your free API key works fine.\n\n**For video generation (Veo/Omni Flash):** **Yes, billing is mandatory.** There is no way around it — video generation costs real compute power and Google does not offer it for free through the API.\n\n**Bottom line:** Until you successfully attach a credit card (not UPI) to your billing account, you cannot generate videos through the API. Your best free option for making AI videos right now is to use **Google Flow directly in the browser** (at [labs.google/flow](https://labs.google/flow)) where you get limited Flow credits with a Google AI Plus/Pro subscription, or use the free daily quota if available."}
