{"step_index":45,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-24T23:28:22Z","content":"Here is the **honest, straight answer** — no sugarcoating:\n\n---\n\n### Is billing just a setup, or will it charge me?\n\n**It WILL charge you real money for every video you generate.** It is NOT just a verification step. Setting up billing means you are giving Google permission to deduct money from your card/UPI for every API call you make.\n\n### How much does each video cost?\n\n| Model | Cost | Example (8-second video) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Veo 3.1 **Fast** | ~\\$0.15/second | **~₹10 per video** |\n| Veo 3.1 **Standard** | ~\\$0.40–\\$0.75/second | **₹27–₹50 per video** |\n\nSo one single 8-second high-quality video can cost you **₹27 to ₹50** (around \\$3–\\$6).\n\n### How many FREE videos can I generate after enabling billing?\n\n**Zero.** There is **no free tier for video generation** (Veo). The moment you generate a video, money is deducted. Google's own pricing page says: *\"Free tier: Not available\"* for Veo.\n\n### Is it safe to add billing?\n\nYour money **WILL be cut** from your account the moment you use video generation. There is no free quota, no trial videos, nothing. Every single generation costs real money.\n\n---\n\n### My Recommendation for You\n\n**Do NOT set up billing** if you only want to make AI videos for free. Instead, use these free alternatives:\n\n1. **Google Flow in the browser** ([labs.google/flow](https://labs.google/flow)) — You get some free generations directly in the website without any API or billing setup\n2. **Kling AI** ([klingai.com](https://klingai.com)) — Gives free daily video credits\n3. **Hailuo AI / MiniMax** — Free video generations daily\n4. **Seedance by ByteDance** — Free tier available\n\nThese are all browser-based, no coding required, no billing required, and no money deducted. You just type a prompt and get a video."}
